inequalities, including the four- and five-hub bridges. -/
theorem book_lattice_full (s : ℕ) : ∀ k : ℕ,2≤ s → 1≤ k → k≤ cliqueCapacity s →
    LatticeExtremeAt (cliqueBook s k) (s+k-1) ((s-1)*k) := by
